  "summary_en": "European Commission staff working document assessing Austria's progress toward the EU Digital Decade 2030 targets: connectivity, SME digitalisation, AI/cloud/data uptake, skills, digital public services and green digital. It reviews national roadmap measures and 2025 recommendations. Embodied AI and robotics are not addressed beyond a passing mention.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Austria is 67% on track against its 2025 Digital Decade trajectory points, and 40% of the 2025 recommendations were addressed.",
   "AI adoption by enterprises is 29.95%, above the EU average of 19.95%.",
   "Fibre and VHCN coverage lag the EU average, and the BBA2030 funding call was cancelled.",
   "Cloud and data analytics uptake is below the EU average, and targeted SME support is recommended.",
   "NIS2 transposition (NISG 2026) creates a Federal Office for Cybersecurity from October 2026."
